---
description: Testing conventions
globs: test/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---
- Test names for acceptance criteria start with `<TICKET> AC-n:`, e.g.
  `'AUTH-001 AC-1: ...'` (see docs/specs; CI matches the ticket id).
- Bug regression tests are named `'<BUG-ID>: ...'`.
- mocktail + bloc_test; shared mocks in `test/helpers/mocks.dart`,
  fixtures in `test/helpers/fixtures.dart`.
- Never weaken an assertion to make a test pass.
